---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="RoHS Certification & Compliance Testing | Eurocert"
  description="Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS Directive 2011/65/EU) compliance testing, chemical analysis and certification by EUROCERT Asia."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/rohs/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,RoHS compliance,RoHS certification,Directive 2011/65/EU,hazardous substances testing,CE marking electrical"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368001/eurocert/c7.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="RoHS"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Directive 2011/65/EU</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">RoHS Certification</h1><h3 class="heading-font text-white/70 text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Restriction of Hazardous Substances</h3><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">The process of demonstrating that a product or material meets the Restriction of Hazardous Substances Directive, prohibiting certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment.</p><div class="mt-8"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/#contact">Click For Free Consultation <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Understanding RoHS</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">RoHS Certification?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">RoHS certification is the process of demonstrating that a product or material meets the Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS) Directive. The Directive prohibits the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment, placing restrictions on the maximum concentrations permitted.</p><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">To obtain RoHS certification, manufacturers must provide evidence through test reports from independent laboratories, declarations of conformity, or certificates issued by third-party certification bodies. The RoHS Directive applies to all EEE placed on the EU market, regardless of origin. Non-compliant manufacturers may face fines and product recalls.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-boxes text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What Products Need RoHS?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The directive covers products such as computers, televisions, digital cameras, and mobile phones. Manufacturers must ensure products carry the CE mark and comply with all relevant EU law provisions before placing them on the market. Compliance is achieved through self-certification.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[420px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784009730/rohs_j1kv0t.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="RoHS Certification"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Since July 1, 2006</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Six Restricted Substances</h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border-red-400/20 text-center"><span class="heading-font font-bold text-3xl block mb-1">Pb</span><span class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Lead</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border-amber-400/20 text-center"><span class="heading-font font-bold text-3xl block mb-1">Hg</span><span class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Mercury</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border-orange-400/20 text-center"><span class="heading-font font-bold text-3xl block mb-1">Cd</span><span class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Cadmium</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border-purple-400/20 text-center"><span class="heading-font font-bold text-3xl block mb-1">Cr6+</span><span class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Hexavalent Chromium</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border bg-pink-500/10 text-pink-400 border-pink-400/20 text-center"><span class="heading-font font-bold text-3xl block mb-1">PBB</span><span class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Polybrominated Biphenyls</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 border-rose-400/20 text-center"><span class="heading-font font-bold text-3xl block mb-1">PBDE</span><span class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Polybrominated Diphenyl Ethers</span></div></div><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Why It Matters</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Benefits of RoHS Certification</h2></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compliance with mandatory requirements for use of hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Avoidance of potential regulatory penalties</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Improved public relations and customer confidence</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Enhanced marketability of products</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-trophy text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">A competitive edge over non-certified products</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Step by Step</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">How to Get RoHS Certified</h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 mb-10"><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white text-center"><div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">01</span></div><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mt-3 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-search text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Find Accredited Lab</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Find a testing laboratory accredited by your country&#x27;s recognized accreditation body.</p></div><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white text-center"><div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">02</span></div><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mt-3 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-flask text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Verify Test Capability</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Ensure the lab can perform all tests required for RoHS certification.</p></div><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white text-center"><div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">03</span></div><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mt-3 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-box text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Submit Samples</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Send product samples along with any other required paperwork to the lab.</p></div><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white text-center"><div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">04</span></div><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mt-3 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Receive Certificate</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">After tests complete, the lab will issue a certificate if your product meets all RoHS requirements.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Conclusion</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">RoHS certification ensures products are safe for the environment. Compliant manufacturing protects health and the planet by reducing hazardous substances. Companies should always strive to meet or exceed RoHS requirements for customer safety and reputation as a responsible manufacturer.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-100 bg-eurogold-50/30"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">On Behalf of Eurocert S.A</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We are offering above services on behalf of Eurocert S.A. With our knowledge, consumers can make informed decisions about which products best suit their needs without having to worry about potential harm from harmful chemicals or materials.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">RoHS Certification Services</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Compliance Testing</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive RoHS compliance testing for electrical and electronic equipment.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Material Analysis</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Detailed material composition analysis and hazardous substance verification.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert guidance on RoHS requirements and substance restriction compliance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous monitoring for RoHS regulation updates and product changes.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation &amp; Reporting</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Technical documentation and Declaration of Conformity for RoHS compliance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supply Chain Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verification of component and material suppliers for RoHS compliance.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="lg:col-span-3"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Why Choose Us</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Why Eurocert?</h3><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Our experienced auditors understand RoHS requir